  25:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_ll_fmc.c ****   ==============================================================================
  26:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_ll_fmc.c ****                         ##### FMC peripheral features #####
  27:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_ll_fmc.c ****   ==============================================================================
  28:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_ll_fmc.c ****   [..] The Flexible memory controller (FMC) includes following memory controllers:
  29:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_ll_fmc.c ****        (+) The NOR/PSRAM memory controller
  30:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_ll_fmc.c ****      (+) The NAND memory controller
  31:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_ll_fmc.c ****        (+) The Synchronous DRAM (SDRAM) controller
ARM GAS  C:\Users\HUAV\AppData\Local\Temp\cc94JM9p.s 			page 2


  32:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_ll_fmc.c **** 
  33:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_ll_fmc.c ****   [..] The FMC functional block makes the interface with synchronous and asynchronous static
  34:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_ll_fmc.c ****        memories and SDRAM memories. Its main purposes are:
  35:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_ll_fmc.c ****        (+) to translate AHB transactions into the appropriate external device protocol
  36:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_ll_fmc.c ****        (+) to meet the access time requirements of the external memory devices
  37:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_ll_fmc.c **** 
  38:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_ll_fmc.c ****   [..] All external memories share the addresses, data and control signals with the controller.
  39:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_ll_fmc.c ****        Each external device is accessed by means of a unique Chip Select. The FMC performs
  40:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_ll_fmc.c ****        only one access at a time to an external device.
  41:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_ll_fmc.c ****        The main features of the FMC controller are the following:
  42:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_ll_fmc.c ****         (+) Interface with static-memory mapped devices including:
  43:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_ll_fmc.c ****            (++) Static random access memory (SRAM)
  44:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_ll_fmc.c ****            (++) Read-only memory (ROM)
  45:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_ll_fmc.c ****            (++) NOR Flash memory/OneNAND Flash memory
  46:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_ll_fmc.c ****            (++) PSRAM (4 memory banks)
  47:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_ll_fmc.c ****            (++) Two banks of NAND Flash memory with ECC hardware to check up to 8 Kbytes of
  48:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_ll_fmc.c ****                 data
  49:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_ll_fmc.c ****         (+) Interface with synchronous DRAM (SDRAM) memories
  50:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_ll_fmc.c ****         (+) Independent Chip Select control for each memory bank
  51:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_ll_fmc.c ****         (+) Independent configuration for each memory bank
  52:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_ll_fmc.c **** 
  53:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_ll_fmc.c ****   @endverbatim
  54:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_ll_fmc.c ****   ******************************************************************************
  55:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_ll_fmc.c ****   */
